    "Compute the web’s local I using b = 20 mm and h = 80 mm.": "Calculez le I local du Web en utilisant b = 20 mm et h = 80 mm.",
    "Concept sketch": "Schéma de principe",
    "Concrete slab": "Dalle en béton",
    "Connect axial force, area, and stress": "Connectez la force axiale, la surface et la contrainte",
