    "ΣFy=0: Ay+180=0. Negative means uplift restraint is needed.": "ΣFy=0 : Ay+180=0. Un signe négatif signifie qu’une retenue contre le soulèvement est nécessaire.",
    "ΣFᵧ = 0 gives Rₐ + 96 = 0. Rₐ = −96 kN, so the pin must resist uplift.": "ΣFᵧ = 0 donne Rₐ + 96 = 0. Rₐ = −96 kN, l’appui articulé doit donc résister au soulèvement.",
    "ΣFᵧ = 90 − CE = 0. CE = +90 kN, so CE is in tension.": "ΣFᵧ = 90 − CE = 0. CE = +90 kN, donc CE est en tension.",
    "ΣFᵧ = Aᵧ + 180 = 0 gives −180 kN. The pin needs to hold the truss down in this idealization.": "ΣFᵧ = Aᵧ + 180 = 0 donne −180 kN. L’appui articulé doit maintenir le treillis dans cette idéalisation.",
    "ΣFᵧ = −180 + 90 + 90 = 0 kN. The horizontal sum is also zero because CD’s +90 kN cancels BC’s −90 kN.": "ΣFᵧ = −180 + 90 + 90 = 0 kN. La somme horizontale est également nulle car le +90 kN de CD annule le −90 kN de BC.",
    "ΣFᵧ = −90 − BD = 0, so BD = −90 kN in compression. Its actual contribution at D is upward.": "ΣFᵧ = −90 − BD = 0, donc BD = −90 kN en compression. Sa contribution réelle en D est ascendante.",
    "ΣFₓ = 0 gives Aₓ + 9 = 0, so Aₓ = −9 kN. The minus sign tells us the force points left.": "ΣFₓ = 0 donne Aₓ + 9 = 0, donc Aₓ = −9 kN. Le signe moins nous indique les points de force restants.",
    "ΣFₓ = 0 · ΣFᵧ = 0 at the joint": "ΣFₓ = 0 · ΣFᵧ = 0 au nœud",
    "ΣFₓ = 0, ΣFᵧ = 0, ΣM = 0. Draw pin, roller, and fixed reactions together as a tiny legend.": "ΣFₓ = 0, ΣFᵧ = 0, ΣM = 0. Dessinez ensemble un appui articulé, un appui mobile et des réactions fixes pour former une petite légende.",
    "ΣFₓ = 90 − CD = 0, so CD = +90 kN in tension.": "ΣFₓ = 90 − CD = 0, donc CD = +90 kN en traction.",
    "ΣFₓ = Aₓ + 90 = 0, so Aₓ = −90 kN. A pushes left against the load.": "ΣFₓ = Aₓ + 90 = 0, donc Aₓ = −90 kN. A pousse à gauche contre la charge.",
    "ΣM about A = 5Bᵧ − 90×10 = 0. Bᵧ = +180 kN.": "ΣM autour de A = 5Bᵧ − 90×10 = 0. Bᵧ = +180 kN.",
